<title>INDONESIA: Great River H1 net soars to 12.9 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Great River H1 net soars to 12.9 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   12.94 vs 6.10</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    50 vs 47</p>
<p>    Net sales			    95.25 vs 76.71</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   23.37 vs 15.41</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    13.62 vs 8.43</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	 43.43 vs 27.59</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is PT Great River International.</p>
</text>
